WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.592
- Good morning, Believe Nation.

00:00:01.592 --> 00:00:02.842
My name is Lily Ma

00:00:02.842 --> 00:00:04.430
and my one word is extraordinary.

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:05.621
I believe that every

00:00:05.621 --> 00:00:06.911
single human being is capable

00:00:06.911 --> 00:00:08.497
of extraordinary things.

00:00:08.497 --> 00:00:10.464
So to hep you on your journey,

00:00:10.464 --> 00:00:11.297
today's message is have

00:00:11.297 --> 00:00:12.955
a champion's mindset.

00:00:12.955 --> 00:00:15.205
Over to you, Conor McGregor.

00:00:15.205 --> 00:00:17.261
(rooster crowing)

00:00:17.261 --> 00:00:20.539
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:20.539 --> 00:00:23.132
♫ Espresso keep me going

00:00:23.132 --> 00:00:27.206
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:27.206 --> 00:00:28.336
- I mean you're enjoying

00:00:28.336 --> 00:00:29.966
great riches and success

00:00:29.966 --> 00:00:31.785
now but can you put
yourself in the mindset

00:00:31.785 --> 00:00:33.030
of the guy who's waiting in line

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.595
with other people.
- Always, always.

00:00:34.595 --> 00:00:35.976
- Do you remember what
that guy was thinking,

00:00:35.976 --> 00:00:37.403
we're you day dreaming of this?

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:38.647
Was that even possible

00:00:38.647 --> 00:00:39.729
to day dream?
- Every second of every day

00:00:39.729 --> 00:00:40.628
I was day dreaming.

00:00:40.628 --> 00:00:42.617
But of course I can go
back and think there.

00:00:42.617 --> 00:00:43.455
I lived there,

00:00:43.455 --> 00:00:44.392
I'd always be there.

00:00:44.392 --> 00:00:47.008
I show up and work every single day

00:00:47.008 --> 00:00:48.612
like I'm not in the position I'm in.

00:00:48.612 --> 00:00:49.548
Like I'm not me.

00:00:49.548 --> 00:00:51.079
So that's the mindset I have

00:00:51.079 --> 00:00:53.262
and it's work.

00:00:53.262 --> 00:00:54.504
- In my opinion,

00:00:54.504 --> 00:00:56.051
having a champion's mindset

00:00:56.051 --> 00:00:57.590
is having the balance between

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.082
not being complacent with your success

00:01:00.082 --> 00:01:02.311
and being grateful for your success.

00:01:02.311 --> 00:01:04.074
So I think about myself

00:01:04.074 --> 00:01:05.886
every single morning I wake up

00:01:05.886 --> 00:01:07.046
with the intention

00:01:07.046 --> 00:01:08.346
that today is going to be

00:01:08.346 --> 00:01:10.086
my hardest working day yet.

00:01:10.086 --> 00:01:12.136
If I have succeeded in something,

00:01:12.136 --> 00:01:13.384
I'm going to push through

00:01:13.384 --> 00:01:15.377
and set higher goals for myself.

00:01:15.377 --> 00:01:17.071
Set my standards even higher and continue

00:01:17.071 --> 00:01:19.926
to work harder every
single day towards my goal.

00:01:19.926 --> 00:01:21.555
How can I be a better coach,

00:01:21.555 --> 00:01:23.325
how can I be a better speaker?

00:01:23.325 --> 00:01:24.581
How can I be a better speaker?

00:01:24.581 --> 00:01:26.302
How can I bring more value to everyone

00:01:26.302 --> 00:01:27.592
that comes into my life?

00:01:27.592 --> 00:01:28.709
But on the other side,

00:01:28.709 --> 00:01:30.180
I am very grateful to have

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:31.220
all the opportunities

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:32.185
that are given to me.

00:01:32.185 --> 00:01:33.869
I am grateful to be standing here

00:01:33.869 --> 00:01:35.275
speaking in front of this camera

00:01:35.275 --> 00:01:36.300
to all of you.

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.204
I am grateful to be able to be a coach

00:01:38.204 --> 00:01:39.394
where I can help others.

00:01:39.394 --> 00:01:40.879
So knowing the balance

00:01:40.879 --> 00:01:42.563
between the two has really helped

00:01:42.563 --> 00:01:44.048
me with my success,

00:01:44.048 --> 00:01:45.616
but also with my fulfillment.

00:01:45.616 --> 00:01:47.436
I wasn't always like this.

00:01:47.436 --> 00:01:49.125
I was more on the side

00:01:49.125 --> 00:01:51.356
of being achievement oriented,

00:01:51.356 --> 00:01:52.764
driven, hard work

00:01:52.764 --> 00:01:54.539
and constantly grinding out, grinding out

00:01:54.539 --> 00:01:55.569
day after day.

00:01:55.569 --> 00:01:58.879
And I found myself really depressed

00:01:58.879 --> 00:02:00.668
even though I was having

00:02:00.668 --> 00:02:02.092
all of these success in my life

00:02:02.092 --> 00:02:04.810
I never took a moment to
really appreciate them.

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:06.627
And as a result, I became

00:02:06.627 --> 00:02:08.996
really upset with who I became

00:02:08.996 --> 00:02:10.870
which is what made me learn

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:12.436
the lesson of gratitude.

00:02:12.436 --> 00:02:14.303
You have to take a moment

00:02:14.303 --> 00:02:16.022
and really be grateful for

00:02:16.022 --> 00:02:18.317
all the things that are coming your way.

00:02:18.317 --> 00:02:20.165
As much as I want to be a better coach,

00:02:20.165 --> 00:02:21.215
I'm already better

00:02:21.215 --> 00:02:22.684
than I was a year ago.

00:02:22.684 --> 00:02:24.223
Being grateful for that

00:02:24.223 --> 00:02:25.670
gives me the fulfillment

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:28.072
to go ahead and do amazing
things with my life.

00:02:28.072 --> 00:02:29.534
And that is why having

00:02:29.534 --> 00:02:30.971
a champion's mindset is

00:02:30.971 --> 00:02:32.555
about having the balance

00:02:32.555 --> 00:02:33.578
between the two.

00:02:33.578 --> 00:02:35.043
Both not being complacent

00:02:35.043 --> 00:02:37.517
and being grateful all at the same time.

00:02:37.517 --> 00:02:39.010
The question of the day is,

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:41.681
what is that one big goal you have

00:02:41.681 --> 00:02:43.176
and what is that one thing

00:02:43.176 --> 00:02:44.690
that you're really grateful for?

00:02:44.690 --> 00:02:46.261
Please write in the comments below

00:02:46.261 --> 00:02:47.941
and I'll join in on the discussion.

00:02:47.941 --> 00:02:48.951
I have a special shout out

00:02:48.951 --> 00:02:50.020
for Marvin Galvan Jr.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:51.449
Thank you so much for picking

00:02:51.449 --> 00:02:52.510
up a copy of Evan's book

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:53.343
Your One Word.

00:02:53.343 --> 00:02:55.788
And I really hope you're
enjoying the read.

00:02:55.788 --> 00:02:57.282
So thank you so much for watching

00:02:57.282 --> 00:02:58.148
We believe in you and I hope you

00:02:58.148 --> 00:03:00.521
continue to believe in yourself.

00:03:00.521 --> 00:03:02.174
And whatever your one word is.

00:03:02.174 --> 00:03:03.428
And we'll see you again

00:03:03.428 --> 00:03:06.275
tomorrow morning for
another sot of Intspresso.

00:03:06.275 --> 00:03:09.334
♫ I wake up every morning

00:03:09.334 --> 00:03:12.751
♫ Espresso keep me going

00:03:16.285 --> 00:03:17.357
- The champion's mindset

00:03:17.357 --> 00:03:18.425
I think a lot of people

00:03:18.425 --> 00:03:19.258
hear the word champion

00:03:19.258 --> 00:03:21.685
they think of a famous sports star.

00:03:21.685 --> 00:03:23.636
You might think of, in the US they might

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:25.189
think of Michael Jordan

00:03:25.189 --> 00:03:28.675
or Lebron James going
and dunking on somebody.

00:03:28.675 --> 00:03:30.798
But, we think of it differently.

00:03:30.798 --> 00:03:32.621
We think of it as well

00:03:32.621 --> 00:03:34.357
when you get on the field,

00:03:34.357 --> 00:03:37.846
put everything you have into it.

00:03:37.846 --> 00:03:40.800
Put every ounce of energy
you have on the field.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:43.623
Leave nothing on the field.

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:47.278
And two, when you get knocked down,

00:03:47.278 --> 00:03:49.241
'cause if you're an entrepreneur

00:03:49.241 --> 00:03:51.797
inevitably you will be.

00:03:51.797 --> 00:03:54.155
When you see hard times

00:03:54.155 --> 00:03:55.738
and you get knocked down

00:03:55.738 --> 00:03:57.196
get back up.

00:03:57.196 --> 00:04:00.572
And if you keep putting
everything you got into it

00:04:00.572 --> 00:04:02.424
and you keep getting back up

00:04:02.424 --> 00:04:03.864
when you get knocked down

00:04:03.864 --> 00:04:06.124
it's almost impossible to fail.

00:04:06.124 --> 00:04:07.485
- Something you said,

00:04:07.485 --> 00:04:09.325
that you're reaching your peak.

00:04:09.325 --> 00:04:10.684
Do you think though

00:04:10.684 --> 00:04:12.161
you can still take it to another level

00:04:12.161 --> 00:04:13.525
or do you think this is

00:04:13.525 --> 00:04:15.187
as good as it gets for you?

00:04:15.187 --> 00:04:17.550
- Well, I like to

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:19.914
use one quote that "the limitations

00:04:19.914 --> 00:04:22.338
exist only in our minds and if you start

00:04:22.338 --> 00:04:23.323
using imagination,

00:04:23.323 --> 00:04:25.468
then your possibilities

00:04:25.468 --> 00:04:26.831
become limitless."

00:04:26.831 --> 00:04:29.686
So, that's kind of a mindset that I have,

00:04:29.686 --> 00:04:31.250
I use my imagination,

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:35.373
I do see myself achieving more,

00:04:35.373 --> 00:04:38.135
I'm hoping, I'm working hard on it.

00:04:38.135 --> 00:04:40.532
Not only myself but entire team around me.

00:04:40.532 --> 00:04:43.079
- And the core business development system

00:04:43.079 --> 00:04:45.331
in any company and every company

00:04:45.331 --> 00:04:47.081
sitting here, no matter what kind

00:04:47.081 --> 00:04:48.226
of company it is,

00:04:48.226 --> 00:04:49.365
is lead generation,

00:04:49.365 --> 00:04:50.887
lead conversion, client fulfillment.

00:04:50.887 --> 00:04:52.116
How many people do

00:04:52.116 --> 00:04:53.497
you attract to your door,

00:04:53.497 --> 00:04:55.135
how do you convert a larger and larger

00:04:55.135 --> 00:04:56.288
percentage of those people

00:04:56.288 --> 00:04:58.438
to become customers and how do you convert

00:04:58.438 --> 00:05:00.537
the largest percentage of those customers

00:05:00.537 --> 00:05:01.911
to become clients?

00:05:01.911 --> 00:05:03.313
And the ball game

00:05:03.313 --> 00:05:05.716
of that is mindset.

00:05:05.716 --> 00:05:09.109
It's truly the paradigm through which you

00:05:09.109 --> 00:05:12.565
approach the building of the systems

00:05:12.565 --> 00:05:15.345
through which leadership
and entrepreneurship

00:05:15.345 --> 00:05:18.063
becomes a reality every
single day in the company.

